# A.I.M. Synthoids: "When this creature enters, surveil 2" (CR 701.25a): the top TWO cards are looked at, so the second one
# (Counterspell) can go to the graveyard while the first (Lightning Bolt) stays on top; a surveil 1 could not reach it. The
# {2} cost is paid exactly by the two {U} left from a Black Lotus after a Sol Ring is cast, so the pool is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
A.I.M. Synthoids
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.A.I.M. Synthoids.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Counterspell)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Counterspell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library = Lightning Bolt; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.A.I.M. Synthoids.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.A.I.M. Synthoids.Toughness = 3
